<title>JAPAN: Japan August zinc imports down 56.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan August zinc imports down 56.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined zinc imports in August totalled 3,007 tonnes, down 56.9 percent from 6,982 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, according to Ministry of Finance data released on Monday.</p>
<p>Figures were as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		     August 96  July 96    August 95</p>
<p> Total		 3,007     3,684	 6,982</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> China		 1,833	 961	 3,322</p>
<p>Refined zinc imports in the first eight months of 1996 totalled 118,892 tonnes, up 31 percent from 90,783 tonnes in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodities Desk (813 3432 6179)</p>
</text>
